  "title": "Qt: Don't try to remove an already removed IO Graph tap",
  "description": "Avoid harmless but scary console warnings about\n\"remove_tap_listener(): no listener found with that tap data\"\nby not trying to remove an IO Graph tap listener if the file\nhas already been closed when the window is destroyed, or if\nthe IO Graph's capture file is closed and then a new file is\nopened (not associated with the tap) and then closed.",
